[center][size=6][b]CardShopCoopCommunity[/b][/size][/center]

[center][url=https://discord.gg/eNswvvTYbQ][img]https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-join%20the%20shop-2ec484[/img][/url][/center]

[b]True co-op multiplayer for TCG Card Shop Simulator.[/b] -- Run your shop with other players! This mod synchronizes your shop with anyone you join's shop, allowing you to run the game the exact same as if you were running it on your own! Join via Steam or via the LAN / internet.

[b]Mod Aware[/b] -- Works with most QoL and mods that add things to the base game. This means new cards, card packs, furniture, workers, etc.

[b]Mod Expandable[/b] -- For mods that add new custom logic, such as the Custom TV mod, the mod owners can expand it. The Custom TV was expanded by us as an example as an optional download!

[size=5][b]Features[/b][/size]
[list]
[*][b]Steam lobbies[/b]: Friends-list invites, or a browsable/searchable public lobby list with optional passwords.[/*]
[*][b]Play over IP[/b]: You can host over IP / LAN if Steam isn't what you want.[/*]
[*][b]Both players can work[/b]: All vanilla gameplay preserved as best as possible, so all users can interact the exact same as the host.[/*]
[*][b]Live world[/b]: all players can see everything the others see, as the other users change and play![/*]
[*][b]Mod-aware[/b]: We network all loaded mods and cards, to ensure each client has the the required content before you join![/*]
[*][b]Joiners risk nothing[/b]: Any games you join work without change to any of your local saves.[/*]
[/list]

[size=5][b]Install[/b][/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://github.com/BepInEx/BepInEx]BepInEx 5[/url] (5.4.23 x64) into the game folder — most modded installs already have it.[/*]
[*]Drop CardShopCoop.dll into BepInEx/plugins/ on [b]both[/b] PCs.[/*]
[*]Both players must run the [b]same CardShopCoopCommunity version[/b] and the [b]same mod set[/b] (including content data packs) — the join handshake tells you exactly what differs if not.[/*]
[*]In game, press [b]F2[/b] for the co-op window. Host: load your save, click Host. Friend: Join via Steam invite, the lobby browser, or a LAN IP (UDP/KCP).[/*]
[/list]

